ing requirements for sports wagering operators and sports wagering suppliers.  Establishes a general excise tax to be levied on sports wagering operator licenses.  Establishes the Problem Gambling Prevention and Treatment Special Fund to be administered and expended by the Department of Health.  Specifies that legal sports wagering and fantasy sports contests shall not be considered contests of chance or gambling.  Authorizes DLE to perform criminal history record checks on applicants and licensees relating to sports wagering.  (SD2)","sponsors":[{"name":"Daniel Holt","primary":true,"classification":"primary","person_id":"ocd-person/0ceb0d53-faa5-4706-a1c5-8ebb45e3b133","party":"Democratic","title":null,"district":null,"chamber":null},{"name":"Darius Kila","primary":true,"classification":"primary","person_id":"ocd-person/76c9a0ff-a9f0-47ac-bf3d-9f8ee134c411","party":"Democratic","title":"Representative","district":"44","chamber":"lower"},{"name":"Chris Todd","primary":true,"classification":"primary","person_id":"ocd-person/6f62978c-5c1e-4a93-b182-caa7b97d45e0","party":"Democratic","title":"Representative","district":"3","chamber":"lower"}],"fetched":"2026-11-02T17:52:25.547Z"}